The page contains one advertisement: the large boxed promotion for **"Die Britische Industrie-Messe 1927"** (The British Industries Fair 1927), advertising the fair held from 21 February to 4 March at White City, London and Castle Bromwich, Birmingham, including the two "KÄUFER" (buyer) information boxes with ticket sources.

Note: The lower boxed section, "Application for Admission to Membership" for the British Chamber of Commerce for Switzerland, is a membership application form rather than an advertisement, so it was not included.
